=head1 DESCRIPTION

Neptune logs are converted to SPARQL quads in the graph using the
Resource Description Framework (RDF) N-QUADS
(https://www.w3.org/TR/n-quads/) language defined in the W3C RDF 1.1
N-Quads specification

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Stmt => Str

Holds an N-QUADS (https://www.w3.org/TR/n-quads/) statement expressing
the changed quad.



